{"sourceUrl":"https://phil.pku.edu.cn/xwgg/tzgg/7baf103dbe9441eeb53a0412cecc6c3c.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:10.813659+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://phil.pku.edu.cn/xwgg/tzgg/7baf103dbe9441eeb53a0412cecc6c3c.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>1、我系按照《北京大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生办法》的要求（见北京大学研究生招生网）接收申请。申请流程及所需提供的申请材料请参照北京大学研究生院招办公布的相关要求。申请材料中的成绩单及成绩排名，须加盖所在学校教务处或院系公章。如申请直博，须提供相应的博士生入学外语水平证明</span><a href=\"https://phil.pku.edu.cn/xwgg/tzgg/7baf103dbe9441eeb53a0412cecc6c3c.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>。</span><a href=\"https://phil.pku.edu.cn/xwgg/tzgg/7baf103dbe9441eeb53a0412cecc6c3c.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://phil.pku.edu.cn/xwgg/tzgg/7baf103dbe9441eeb53a0412cecc6c3c.htm#_edn1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>[*]</span></a></p>\n<p><span>2、申请者须为全国高校应届毕业生，满足《北京大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生办法》所规定的各项申报条件。</span></p>\n<p><span>3、申请者须按照《北京大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生办法》的规定向我系提交</span><span>电子版和纸质版</span><span>申请材料。</span></p>\n<p><span>电子版申请材料请按顺序扫描材料，汇总为一个pdf文档，以“姓名-报考专业”命名，务必于2026年9月8日中午12点前发送至邮箱：jing.tong@pku.edu.cn。请务必及时发送电子版，复试资格审核主要参考电子版申请。</span></p>\n<p><span>纸质版申请材料按顺序用长尾夹整理好，请于2026年9月10日中午12点前送至或寄达至哲学系李兆基人文学苑2号楼103办公室，童老师，电话：62755356）。纸质版申请材料请务必用EMS快递寄送，其他快递无法送达。如有特殊情况，请及时联系我系。</span></p>\n<p><span>4、我系将组织复试小组对提交的申请材料进行审核，择优确定复试资格名单。</span></p>\n<p><span>5、复试分为笔试和面试两项。</span></p>\n<p><span>笔试总分100分，包括英语40分和哲学基础知识60分（哲学基础知识部分，逻辑学专业考核逻辑学基础知识，其他专业考核中国哲学、西方哲学、马克思主义哲学基础知识各20分）。笔试时长为150分钟。</span></p>\n<p><span>面试由各教研室组织专业小组分别进行。</span></p>\n<p><span>面试与笔试成绩的权重各为50%，有一项不合格不予录取。</span></p>\n<p><span>6、复试预计将于9月17日-18日进行。复试安排与复试名单预计不晚于9月12日在哲学系网站公布。请考生保持联系方式畅通。</span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>北京大学哲学系宗教学系</span></p>\n<p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> 2026年8月31日</span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</div>\n<hr/>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"https://phil.pku.edu.cn/xwgg/tzgg/7baf103dbe9441eeb53a0412cecc6c3c.htm#_ednref1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>[*]</span></a><span> 哲学系博士生入学外语水平证明要求：</span></p>\n<p>5<span>年内取得且至入学时仍在有效期内的外语水平证明复印件（有效期依外语水平证明的类型具体确定，有效期自入学年的</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日起向前推算）。以下外语证明材料选择一种：</span></p>\n<p><span>英语：</span></p>\n<div>\n<p><span>①<span> </span></span><span>国家英语六级</span>520<span>分（含）以上（</span>2022<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日之后参加考试）；</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span>②<span> </span></span><span>托福（</span>IBT<span>）</span>90<span>分（含）以上（</span>2025<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日之后参加考试）；</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span>③<span> </span></span><span>雅思（</span>A<span>类）</span>6.5<span>分（含）以上（</span>2025<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日之后参加考试）；</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span>④<span> </span></span>GRE <span>总分</span>305<span>分（含）以上，其中作文</span>3<span>分（含）以上（</span>2022<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日之后参加考试）；</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span>⑤<span> </span></span><span>英语专业八级证书（</span>2022<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日之后参加考试）。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span>小语种：</span></p>\n<p><span>法语：法语水平考试（</span>TEF<span>）</span>B2<span>及以上等级（</span>2026<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日以后参加考试）；</span></p>\n<p><span>德语：德福（</span>TestDaF<span>）考试</span>3<span>级及以上等级（</span>2022<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日以后参加考试）；</span></p>\n<p><span>日语：日本语能力测试</span>(<span>（</span>JLPT <span>）</span>N1<span>级（</span>­2022<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日以后参加考试）；</span></p>\n<p><span>俄语：俄语专业八级合格证书（</span>2022<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日以后参加考试）</span></p>\n<p><span>对外俄语等级考试（ТРКИ）</span>B2<span>及以上等级（</span>2022<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>1<span>日以后参加考试）。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"9935fb9b796107b8d9d1e162e204115ce88eb1ebfbf6e2978c2d5eac126bf275","textLength":1214,"sourceSha256":"757aaa012f41c26f83a7f01487b3ebd9db898aef86f3378c091dbff8f6ef83c5","selector":"article-like:article art","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2a703433e63e8b4aad6d","title":"2026年北京大学哲学系关于接收2027年推荐免试研究生的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:10.813659+00:00"}
